Z||000000||FieroPerformance||07-04-2001||04:50 PM||||I bought an 8" Rockford Fosgate HX2 DVC off of ebay. My original plan was to mount it in the factory location but I quickly learned that my sub (which peaks at 800 watts) requires more space than a typical 8". My dad and I are constructing a box that will sit in the passenger footwell. The face of the sub will be pointing upward to avoid someone putting their foot through it while entering or exiting the vehicle. The front of the box (not on in the pictures) will double as a foot rest. I still need to cut the hole for the wires, cover the box in resin to seal it and paint it. Lemme know what you guys think of it so far.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox3.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mybox4.jpg"> <P>-Charlie<BR>------<BR>jackalrr@hotmail.com<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic.jpg"> ||||reg||3
