Z||000005||FieroPerformance||07-05-2001||01:16 PM||||RiceCooker,<P>   Heh thanks, I really like your wheels too. I love the way Blades look on Fieros. Anyway, here is a thread where I've posted more pics <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008599.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008599.html</A>  .<P>Also, how much time and money do you have in your car? It is like the bat mobile with all that cool stuff. I love the way you mounted your security control.<P>-Charlie<BR>----<BR>jackalrr@hotmail.com<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||RiceCooker||07-05-2001||02:49 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroPerformance:<BR><B>RiceCooker,<P>   Heh thanks, I really like your wheels too. I love the way Blades look on Fieros. Anyway, here is a thread where I've posted more pics <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008599.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008599.html</A>  .<P>Also, how much time and money do you have in your car? It is like the bat mobile with all that cool stuff. I love the way you mounted your security control.<P>-Charlie<BR>----<BR>jackalrr@hotmail.com<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Thanks for the compliments Charlie<BR>Yeah, I know of at least six fieros now that have TSW blades, not too bad considering they were discontinued almost 2 years ago.<P>I spend a lot more time driving my fiero than working on it, as for the money? Let's give this a shot. I don't want to add up how much repairs etc have costed me cause it's not pretty.<BR>As for the mods, here we go: (cringing)<P>Exhaust, etc. : $2500<BR>Tires: $1050<BR>Wheels: $1100<BR>Security: $400<BR>Tint: $120<BR>License Plate (yes it counts): $180<BR>K&N: Does not count<BR>Speakers: $400<BR>Amp: $400<BR>Deck/Changer: $450<BR>Carpet: $35<BR>Carbon Fiber Film: $30<BR>Shift nob: $35<BR>Toiletpaper for passengers: Priceless  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Yikes!!!!! <BR>It's not even close to being worth that much. To me though, it's priceless. <P>I really do need to take some new pics though.<P>That link you posted was just the link to this page.<P>Later,<BR>Todd<P>------------------<BR>This is my witty signature,<BR>It makes me cool||||reg||1
